#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:8
msgid "3D box"
msgstr "三维盒子"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:10
msgid "All the input files can be found in |3Dbox| directory."
msgstr "所有的输入文件均可在\\ |3Dbox|\\ 目录中找到。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:12
msgid ""
"This example is based on models in "
":numref:`cookbook_nonUniformFixedValueBC` and :numref:`cookbook_gmsh`. We"
" just to make the following three changes to make a 3D box model,"
msgstr ""
"此例子是基于\\ :numref:`cookbook_nonUniformFixedValueBC`\\ 和\\ "
":numref:`cookbook_gmsh`\\ 中的离子。我们只需要做出如下所示的三个修改就可以得到一个三维盒子模型的算例。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:15
msgid ""
"For mesh generation, we just need to change :code:`zmax=xmax;` and change"
" the extrude layers to a number greater than 1, e.g. 40, see line 7 and "
"line 28 in :numref:`lst:gmsh:box.geo`."
msgstr ""
"对于网格生成，我们只需要修改\\ :code:`zmax=xmax;`\\ 并且将延伸层数改为大于1（比如40）即可, 见\\ "
":numref:`lst:gmsh:box.geo`\\ 中的第7行和第28行。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:17
msgid ""
"For boundary conditions, we just need to change :code:`type` of "
":code:`frontAndBack` boundary to be consistent with the :code:`left` and "
":code:`right` boundary, rather than :code:`empty`. And then change "
":code:`bottom` boundary condition of :code:`T` similar to example "
":numref:`cookbook_nonUniformFixedValueBC`, see :numref:`lst:3Dbox:BC_T`."
msgstr ""
"对于边界条件, 我们只需要将\\ :code:`frontAndBack`\\ 的\\ :code:`type`\\ 改为与\\ "
":code:`left`\\ 和\\ :code:`right`\\ 边界相同即可。然后将\\ :code:`bottom`\\ 边界的温度\\ "
":code:`T`\\ 边界条件改为与\\ :numref:`cookbook_nonUniformFixedValueBC`\\ 中的类似即可,"
" 见\\ :numref:`lst:3Dbox:BC_T`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:19
msgid ""
"Unlike 2D model, we don't need to set :code:`frontAndBack` to empty patch"
" in :code:`polyMesh/boundary` file. See :numref:`sec:convertGmsh` for "
"empty boundary of 2D model."
msgstr ""
"与二维模型不同，我们并不需要将\\ :code:`polyMesh/boundary`\\ 文件中的\\ "
":code:`frontAndBack`\\ 边界的类型设置为\\ :code:`empty`\\ 。二维模型的空边界条件类型设置见\\ "
":numref:`sec:convertGmsh`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/3Dbox.rst:21
