#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:8
msgid "Hello World: 2D box"
msgstr "Hello World: 二维盒子"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:10
msgid "All the input files can be found in |helloworld| directory."
msgstr "所有的输入文件均可在\\ |helloworld|\\ 目录中找到。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:12
msgid ""
"This is the firs simplest example to show the basic steps to run a case. "
"The geometry and boundary conditions are shown in figure "
":numref:`fig:geometry_2Dbox`. The following steps present how to setup a "
"case from scratch, see `helloworld "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/tree/master/cookbooks/helloworld>`_"
" case."
msgstr ""
"这是第一个最简单的例子，用于展示设置算例的基本步骤。模型几何结构和边界条件见\\ :numref:`fig:geometry_2Dbox`\\ "
"。下列的步骤展示如何从0开始设置一个模型算例。输入文件见\\ `helloworld "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/tree/master/cookbooks/helloworld>`_\\"
" 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:21
msgid "The geometry and boundary conditions of the 2D box model."
msgstr "二维盒子模型的几何结构和边界条件"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:24
msgid "Step 1: create :code:`controlDict` file"
msgstr "第一步：创建\\ :code:`controlDict`\\ 文件"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:26
msgid ""
"First thing we have to do is create a case directory, e.g. named "
":code:`helloworld`, and sub-directory :code:`system` (see "
":numref:`lst:createCaseDir`)."
msgstr ""
"我们需要做的第一件事就是创建一个算例目录，比如\\ :code:`helloworld`, 以及一个子目录\\ :code:`system` "
"(见\\ :numref:`lst:createCaseDir`)。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:28
msgid "Create case directory."
msgstr "创建算例目录"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:37
msgid ""
"The :code:`controlDict` file is the first and most important file, which "
"is located at :code:`system` directory. Create :code:`controlDict` file "
"in :code:`system` directory with script shown in "
":numref:`lst:helloworld:controlDict`."
msgstr ""
":code:`controlDict`\\ 字典文件是第一个需要创建的文件也是最重要的一个, 位于\\ :code:`system`\\ "
"目录。其内容见\\ :numref:`lst:helloworld:controlDict`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:40
msgid ":code:`controlDict`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:49
msgid ""
"The key entry :code:`application` has to be set to "
":code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam` which is the solver name."
msgstr ""
"其中的\\ :code:`application`\\ 关键词必须设置为\\ "
":code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:52
msgid "Step 2: mesh generation"
msgstr "第二步：网格生成"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:54
msgid ""
"In this step we create dictionary :code:`blockMeshDict` (just copy "
":numref:`lst:blockMeshDict`) in :code:`system` to setup geometry of the "
"2D box. Then we just run command :code:`blockMesh` to generate mesh (see "
":numref:`fig:geometry_2Dbox`). The directory :code:`constant` will be "
"created automatically and the mesh files will be generated in "
":code:`polyMesh` directory."
msgstr ""
"在这一步我们需要在\\ :code:`system`\\ 目录下创建一个 :code:`blockMeshDict`\\ 字典文件(只需要将\\ "
":numref:`lst:blockMeshDict`\\ "
"中的内容拷贝过来就行)，此文件定义了二维盒子模型的几何结构及网格划分信息。然后在算例目录下运行\\ :code:`blockMesh`\\ "
"命令生成网格(见\\ :numref:`fig:geometry_2Dbox`)。然后就自动生成一个名为\\ :code:`constant`\\"
" 子文件夹，并且网格文件都保存在其下的\\ :code:`polyMesh`\\ 目录中了。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:61
msgid ""
"After step 2, the mesh is basically generated and we can display using "
":code:`paraFoam` utility default or using ParaView for Docker user. The "
"mesh result is shown in :numref:`fig:helloworld:mesh_PV`."
msgstr ""
"第二步之后，网格就已经生成了，这时候我们可以用\\ :code:`paraFoam`\\ "
"工具在Paraview中显示我们生成的网格了，显示结果的截图见\\ :numref:`fig:helloworld:mesh_PV`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:68
msgid "The screenshot of 2D box mesh in ParaView."
msgstr "二维盒子模型的网格在Paraview中的显示截图"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:71
msgid "Step 3: field data in :code:`0` folder"
msgstr "第三步：创建\\ :code:`0`\\ 目录下的场数据文件"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:73
msgid ""
"In this step, we need to create I/O data files of field :code:`p`, "
":code:`T` and :code:`permeability` in :code:`0` time directory. This "
"three files are shown in :code:`lst:helloworld:p`, "
":code:`lst:helloworld:T` and :code:`lst:helloworld:permeability`, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"在这一步，我们需要在\\ :code:`0`\\ 时间目录中创建场数据\\ :code:`p`, :code:`T` 和 "
":code:`permeability`\\ 的输入文件。这三个文件的内容分别显示为\\ :code:`lst:helloworld:p`, "
":code:`lst:helloworld:T` 和 :code:`lst:helloworld:permeability`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:76
msgid "Data field :code:`p`."
msgstr "压力场：\\ :code:`p`"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:83
msgid "Data field :code:`T`."
msgstr "温度场：\\ :code:`T`"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:90
msgid "Data field :code:`permeability`."
msgstr "渗透率：\\ :code:`permeability`"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:99
msgid ""
"Now we can display the initial filed of :code:`p`, :code:`T` and "
":code:`permeability` using ParaView. Screenshot of field :code:`T` is "
"shown in :numref:`fig:helloworld:initial_T_PV`. In order to view the "
"initial filed, the user have to uncheck the checkbox of :code:`Skip Zero "
"Time` (see red rectangle in the figure)"
msgstr ""
"现在我们可以使用Paraview显示\\ :code:`p`, :code:`T` 和 :code:`permeability`\\ "
"的初始场了。\\ :code:`T`\\ 的显示结果截图见\\ :numref:`fig:helloworld:initial_T_PV`\\ "
"。为了显示初始场，必须将Paraview中的\\ :code:`Skip Zero Time`\\ 复选框取消选中(如图中的红色方框所示)"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:107
msgid "The screenshot of field :code:`T` in ParaView."
msgstr "温度场\\ :code:`T`\\ 的初始场在Paraview中的显示截图"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:111
msgid "Step 4: constant property files"
msgstr "第四步：属性文件"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:113
msgid ""
"In this step we need to copy three constant files :code:`g` (shown in "
":numref:`lst:helloworld:g`), :code:`thermophysicalProperties` "
"(:numref:`lst:thermophysicalProperties`) and :code:`transportProperties` "
"(:numref:`lst:transportProperties`) into the :code:`constant` directory."
msgstr ""
"这一步，我们需要将三个常数/属性文件\\ :code:`g` (见\\ :numref:`lst:helloworld:g`), "
":code:`thermophysicalProperties` "
"(:numref:`lst:thermophysicalProperties`)和\\ :code:`transportProperties` "
"(:numref:`lst:transportProperties`)拷贝到\\ :code:`constant`\\ 目录下。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:119
msgid "Constant property file :code:`g`."
msgstr "常数\\ :code:`g`\\ 的字典文件"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:128
msgid ""
"The user can change some propertie values in :code:`transportProperties`,"
" e.g. :code:`porosity`, accroding to a specific modeling problem."
msgstr ""
"用户可以根据自己的研究问题修改\\ :code:`transportProperties`\\ 文件中的一些参数，比如\\ "
":code:`porosity`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:132
msgid "Step 5: setup numerical schemes and solution control"
msgstr "第五步：设置数值格式和求解控制"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:134
msgid ""
"In this step we will create numerical schemes and solution control "
"dictionary file :code:`fvSchemes` and :code:`fvSolution` in "
":code:`system` directory. These two files can be found in "
":numref:`lst:fvSchemes` and :numref:`lst:fvSolution` in "
":numref:`sec:system`."
msgstr ""
"这一步我们需要在\\ :code:`system`\\ 目录下创建两个文件，分别为: :code:`fvSchemes`\\ 和\\ "
":code:`fvSolution`\\ 这两个文件的内容分别见\\ :numref:`sec:system`\\ 中的\\ "
":numref:`lst:fvSchemes`\\ 和\\ :numref:`lst:fvSolution`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:139
msgid "Step 6: run the case"
msgstr "第六步：运行算例"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:141
msgid ""
"Now the simple case setup or pre-processing has been completed. The we "
"just run the following simple command (:numref:`lst:helloworld:run`) to "
"run the case."
msgstr "到此为止，这个简单的算例以设置完毕。只需要在算例目录下运行两行简单的命令(:numref:`lst:helloworld:run`)即可运行算例。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:144
