#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:180
msgid "Temperature result of the **hello world** model."
msgstr "**hello world**\\ 模型的温度结果"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/helloworld.rst:186
msgid ""
"If users want to run a case for a long time, there is an excellent tool "
"named tmux_ , which is a terminal multiplexer. It lets you switch easily "
"between several programs in one terminal, detach them (they keep running "
"in the background) and reattach them to a different terminal."
msgstr ""
"如果用户想长时间在后台运行算例，推荐一个优秀的终端控制工具\\ tmux_ , "
"可以方便的在多个终端中切换，并且可以让一个终端命令在后台运行，即使关闭终端窗口也不会影响程序运行。而且还可以在此进入到挂起的终端中。详情见其官网。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/index.rst:6
msgid "Convection in a box"
msgstr "盒子中的热液对流"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"In this first example, let us consider a simple situation: a 2d box that "
"is heated from below, insulated at the side walls, and cooled from the "
"top. We will start from a 2D box example and then make some changes to "
"show its features."
msgstr "作为第一个例子，我们考虑一个简单的情况：有一个二维的盒子，从底部加热，两侧是绝热非渗透性的，并且流体可以在顶部自由出入，从顶部进入的流体是冷的，出去的是热的。我们将从这个简单的二维模型开始，然后一步一步做一些修改得到新的模型算例，在此过程中展示本软件的一些特性。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/nonuniformFixedValueBC.rst:6
msgid "Nonuniform fixed temperature BC"
msgstr "非均匀的固定值温度边界条件"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/nonuniformFixedValueBC.rst:8
msgid "All the input files can be found in |nonUniformFixedValueBC| directory."
msgstr "所有的输入文件均可在\\ |nonUniformFixedValueBC|\\ 目录中找到。"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/nonuniformFixedValueBC.rst:10
msgid ""
"This exmple, based on :ref:`cookbook_helloworld`, presents how to set a "
"nonuniform fixed boundary condition by using :code:`codedFixedValue` BC "
"type (see :numref:`lst:nonUniformFixedValueBC:T`)"
msgstr ""
"此例子基于\\ :ref:`cookbook_helloworld`\\ ，用来展示如何设置使用\\ "
":code:`codedFixedValue`\\ 边界条件类型设置非均匀的固定值边界条件。(见 "
":numref:`lst:nonUniformFixedValueBC:T`)"

#: ../../source/Cookbooks/box/nonuniformFixedValueBC.rst:12
msgid "Example of nonuniform boundary condition: :code:`codedFixedValue`."
msgstr "非均匀固定值边界条件:\\ :code:`codedFixedValue`\\ 示例"

